sentences.l:
If there is no favour of the mother,
let the daughter move the father; and let your care for her not be,
we pray, cheaper because she was brought forth by our childbearing.

sentences.t:
Sed si modo nomina rebus
addere vera placet, non hoc iniuria factum,
verum amor est;

sentences.l:
But if only it is agreeable to add true names
to things, this deed is not an injury
but love;
